{
  "name": "00 · create ticket (shared)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 00 · create ticket (shared)\nThe one place where a customer message becomes an agentdesk ticket. Called by **01 · intake webhook** and **02 · contact form**.\n\nInput: `email`, `message`, optional `order`, `subject`, `channel`, `id`.\nOutput: `{ ok, ticket_id, duplicate }` or `{ ok: false, error }`.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "agentdesk-0001",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Failure handling\n- Invalid input never reaches the API.\n- The API call retries **3 times, 2 s apart**.\n- After that the error output alerts on Telegram and returns `ok: false`, so the caller can tell the customer to retry.\n- The API itself is idempotent on `external_id`: a retry never creates a second ticket.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "agentdesk-0002",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "agentdesk-0003",
      "name": "When called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One shape for every channel: email, order number and message in, an API ticket out.\nconst b = $input.first().json;\nconst email = String(b.email ?? b.customer_email ?? '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst body = String(b.message ?? b.body ?? '').trim();\nconst order = String(b.order ?? '').trim().toUpperCase();\nif (!/^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(email) || body.length < 3) {\n  return [{ json: { valid: false, error: 'A valid email and a message are required.' } }];\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: true,\n    ticket: {\n      channel: ['chat', 'form', 'email'].includes(b.channel) ? b.channel : 'form',\n      customer_email: email,\n      subject: order ? `Order ${order}` : (b.subject ?? null),\n      body: (order && !body.includes(order) ? `${body}\\n\\nOrder: ${order}` : body).slice(0, 10000),\n      // The sender's own message id: a redelivered message becomes one ticket, not two.\n      external_id: b.id ? `n8n-${b.id}` : undefined,\n    },\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "agentdesk-0004",
      "name": "Normalize and validate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "agentdesk-0005",
      "name": "Valid?",
